{
 "duration": 24.516,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Ben walked hills for a month before his big park hike,",
   "start": 0.3,
   "end": 3.131
  },
  {
   "text": "always with an empty daypack.",
   "start": 3.231,
   "end": 4.815
  },
  {
   "text": "On trip day it held water, food and warm layers,",
   "start": 5.065,
   "end": 8.0
  },
  {
   "text": "and after two miles it felt like a brick.",
   "start": 8.1,
   "end": 10.216
  },
  {
   "text": "Here's the fix. Train with the pack you will carry.",
   "start": 10.666,
   "end": 13.331
  },
  {
   "text": "Add a little weight each week, like one more water bottle.",
   "start": 13.581,
   "end": 16.619
  },
  {
   "text": "Then do one long dress rehearsal hike before the trip.",
   "start": 16.869,
   "end": 19.781
  },
  {
   "text": "This time the climb felt normal.",
   "start": 20.181,
   "end": 21.907
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this before your next training walk.",
   "start": 22.307,
   "end": 24.316
  }
 ],
